    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Translators (Chinese)",
      "text": "$(bold)ch_zn$()$(italic)$(list)CatalystGinger$(list)GuoDaiYi$(list)njt-233$(list)Kasualix"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Translators (French)",
      "text": "$(bold)fr-fr$()$(italic)$(list)COwOkie"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Translators (Brazilian)",
      "text": "$(bold)pt-br$()$(italic)$(list)FITFC"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Translators (Spanish)",
      "text": "$(bold)es-es$()$(italic)$(list)GhostOfCazador$(list)elAltrex"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Translators (Korean)",
      "text": "$(bold)ko-kr$()$(italic)$(list)Mexwell12"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Translators (Russian)",
      "text": "$(bold)ru-ru$()$(italic)$(list)MasterXort"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Stamina",
  "icon": "minecraft:golden_apple",
  "category": "parcool:category_about",
  "sortnum": 3,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This mod adds a concept of Stamina to game.$(br2)Stamina is consumed when you do ParCool moves. When you run out of stamina, penalty is imposed on you.$(list)Disable to sprint and be slow down$(list)Disable most of ParCool actions$(br)Please be careful."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Breakfall",
  "icon": "minecraft:slime_ball",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)Breakfalls$() are skills to protect us from impact of landing.$(br2) 2 types of breakfall are implemented : $(bold)Roll$() and $(bold)Safety Tap$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/breakfall_tap.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Roll",
      "text": "$(bold)Roll$() is one of the Breakfalls. It change an impact of landing into energy of rolling.$(br2)This is sometimes misunderstood, but the $(italic)Roll$() of parkour is landing technique, so ParCool's roll is also used only when you land."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Land while you press forward or backward movement key and Breakfall($(k:parcool.Breakfall)) Key"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Safety Tap",
      "text": "$(bold)Safety Tap$() is one of the Breakfalls. It absorb an impact by bending your legs.$(br2)By the way how can Steve bend his legs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Land while you press Breakfall($(k:parcool.Breakfall)) Key"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Catleap",
  "icon": "minecraft:cat_spawn_egg",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)Catleap$() is a skill used to jump and cling to top of walls,fence or etc.$(br)This is said to be one of basic skills of parkour.$(br)Traceurs absorb an impact of landing with movement of legs.$(br2)In this mod, this is implemented as a long jump. Please careful with the cool time."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() Do $(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)Fast Run$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() Sneak quickly$(br)$(bold)3.$() Cancel sneaking quickly$(br2)I recommend also using $(l:parcool:actions/cling_to_cliff)Cling To Cliff$()."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Charge Jump",
  "icon": "minecraft:rabbit_foot",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can use $(bold)Charge Jump$() for jumping up higher.$(br)This helps you get over fences and climb high wall.$(br2)Though a simple skill, it should be helpful for you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/charge_jump_1.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() Stand in place and sneak for few seconds $(br)$(bold)2.$() Release shift key and press jump key simultaneously."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Pole Climbing",
  "icon": "minecraft:quartz_pillar",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can climb pole-like blocks, such as stacked fences, chains, iron bars and etc."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Cling To Cliff",
  "icon": "minecraft:stone",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can cling to edge of blocks and stay there. Of course, it is possible to move although slowly.$(br) You can also climb up onto the blocks by pressing jump key."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/cling_to_cliff_1.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/cling_to_cliff_2.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Press Cling-To-Cliff Key($(k:parcool.ClingToCliff)) by a wall$(br)"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Crawl",
  "icon": "minecraft:nautilus_shell",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can crawl everywhere and go through narrow course.$(br)Please check also $(l:parcool:actions/slide)Slide$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/crawl.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Press Crawl Key($(k:parcool.Crawl))"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Dive",
  "icon": "minecraft:cod",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "ParCool has special jumping animation: $(bold)Diving$(). Let's see it by third-person view. In addition by pressing jump key again after a few seconds, Dive goes Sky-Diving."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/dive.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() Do $(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)Fast Run$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() Jump into enough space from a high place"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Dodge",
  "icon": "minecraft:arrow",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)Dodge$() is action for avoiding bullets or arrows. You can quickly move short distance. $(br)However be careful with cool time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/dodge.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Press movement keys twice(impossible with forward key)$(list)Press movement key and Dodge key($(k:parcool.Dodge))"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Fast Run",
  "icon": "minecraft:diamond_boots",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Now you are an parkour player! so you can run faster than before. This is a basis of ParCool. Some other actions need using this."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/fast_run.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Continue to press Fast Run key($(k:parcool.FastRun)) during sprinting"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Fast Swim",
  "icon": "minecraft:water_bucket",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Also you can swim faster than before : $(bold)Fast Swim$(). It contains original animation.$(br2)Its operation is same as one of Fast Run."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Continue to press Fast Run key($(k:parcool.FastRun)) during sprinting"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Flipping",
  "icon": "minecraft:blaze_powder",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "ParCool adds a special animation of jump: $(bold)Flipping$().$(br2) You can do front-flip and back-flip."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/flipping_2.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Press left and right movement key simultaneously$(list)Press Flipping key($(k:parcool.Flipping))"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Hang Down",
  "icon": "minecraft:stone",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can hang on some blocks like chains or end rods.$(br2)It's also possible to move and jump forward by pressing jump key."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/hang_down.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Press Hang Down Key($(k:parcool.HangDown)) below horizontal thin blocks$(br)"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Hide in Block",
  "icon": "minecraft:hay_block",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "It's possible to hide in blocks.$(br2)Hiding players get harder to find by enemies. Name is also hidden from other players.$(br2)These below blocks is you can hide in$(list)Leaves block$(list)Hay block"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/hide_in_block.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Press Hide-In-Block Key($(k:parcool.HideInBlock)) while sneaking near blocks you want to hide in"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Horizontal Wall Run",
  "icon": "minecraft:bricks",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can run horizontally sticking to wall. This should help you to jump to a distance platform.$(br2)Although Sometimes misunderstood, the technique of $(l:actions/wall_run)Wall Run$() is vertical one, not horizontal."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/horizontal_wall_run.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() Do $(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)Fast Run$() in air along the wall$(br)$(bold)2.$() Continue to press Wall-Run Key($(k:parcool.HorizontalWallRun))"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Quick Turn",
  "icon": "minecraft:iron_helmet",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Sometimes you may want to turn quickly backward. Press only one key to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Press Quick Turn key($(k:parcool.QuickTurn))"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Slide",
  "icon": "minecraft:yellow_dye",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)Slide$() is an action derived from $(l:parcool:actions/crawl)Crawl$(). You can go through narrow space quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/slide.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)do Crawl while doing $(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)Fast Run$()"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Vault",
  "icon": "minecraft:oak_fence",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)Vault$() is skills used to get over obstacles like fences.$(br)There are numerous variations. In this game, you can use $(italic)Speed Vault$() and $(italic)Kong Vault$()"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/speed_vault.png"
      ],
      "title": "Speed Vault$"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() Do $(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)Fast Run$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() Collide with blocks"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Wall Jump",
  "icon": "minecraft:leather_boots",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Wall Jump, is a skill to jump more by kicking wall. You need to have your back to the wall.$(br)However, you cannot gain height when kicking icy blocks!"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Press Wall-Jump key($(k:parcool.WallJump)) by walls in air"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Wall Run",
  "icon": "minecraft:stone_bricks",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(bold)Wall Run$() is a technique to jump vertically using a wall, to get over it.$(br)Don't mistake this for $(l:actions/horizontal_wall_run)Horizontal Wall Run$().$(br)$(br)Please note that you fail wall running if the wall is made of slippery material like ice block."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/vertical_wall_run.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(bold)1.$() Look above horizontal line and take running up with $(l:parcool:actions/fast_run)Fast Run$()$(br)$(bold)2.$() Jump onto wall with not releasing jump key.$(br)$(br)It may be little difficult but try it."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Wall Slide",
  "icon": "minecraft:sand",
  "category": "parcool:category_actions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You can fall slowly by cling to wall. This action is affected by the slipperiness of blocks, so players cannot make fall slow with wall of ice block."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list)Press Wall Slide key($(k:parcool.WallSlide)) by walls in air"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Energy Drink",
  "icon": "minecraft:potion{\"Potion\":\"parcool:energy_drink\"}",
  "category": "parcool:category_support_features",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "You frequently run out of your stamina? Let's $(strike)modify config$() make $(bold)Energy Drink$(). You can do ParCool moves without consuming stamina!"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:potion{\"Potion\":\"parcool:energy_drink\"}",
      "title": "Making Energy Drink",
      "text": "Energy Drinks can be made with brewing stand.$(br2)The recipe is$(list)[Awkward Potion] + [Nether Quartz]$(list)[Poor Quality Energy Drink] + [Nether Quartz]"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:potion{\"Potion\":\"parcool:poor_energy_drink\"}",
      "title": "Poor Quality Drink",
      "text": "Poor Quality Energy Drinks is low quality version of Energy Drink. This is easy to making but have some bad effects.$(br2)The recipe is$(list)[Awkward Potion] + [Poisonous Potato]$(list)[Awkward Potion] + [Chicken]"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Passive Actions",
  "icon": "minecraft:brick",
  "category": "parcool:category_support_features",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "ParCool adds some passive abilities and animations."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Falling Animation",
      "text": "New animation for long-time falling is added. If you think this is annoying, you can turn it off by config."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Zipline",
  "icon": "parcool:zipline_rope",
  "category": "parcool:category_support_features",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Zipline is a parkour facility, this connects distant 2 points and enable players to move from one side to other end."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "border": "true",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/ride_zipline.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Zipline Hook",
      "text": "First please decide 2 point to set zipline. Then we have to place Zipline Hooks at each place.$(br2)There are 2 types zipline hook. Wooden one and one made by Iron."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "parcool:wooden_zipline_hook",
      "recipe2": "parcool:iron_zipline_hook"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Zipline Rope",
      "text": "Did you place hooks? Then next let's craft Zipline Rope. Use the item while sneaking to change rope tension.$(br2)To set zipline, use zipline rope to 2 zipline hook. Then the 2 point should be connected by zipline"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "parcool:zipline_rope"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "How to Use",
      "text": "$(list) Jump to approach zipline and to press Ride-Zipline Key($(k:parcool.RideZipline))"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "關於跑酷（ParCool）",
  "description": "  本章節提供了關於本模組的概念理念以及基本信息的說明。",
  "icon": "minecraft:book",
  "sortnum": 0
}

{
  "name": "跑酷動作",
  "description": "  本章節提供了關於模組新增跑酷動作的說明。本模組內含多種跑酷技術，讓我們來看看如何去使用它們吧！",
  "icon": "minecraft:feather",
  "sortnum": 1
}

{
  "name": "其他功能",
  "description": "  本章節提供了本模組所添加的各種與跑酷相關功能的說明。",
  "icon": "minecraft:iron_hoe",
  "sortnum": 2
}

{
  "name": "什麼是ParCool？",
  "icon": "minecraft:feather",
  "category": "parcool:category_about",
  "sortnum": 0,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "感謝遊玩本模組！$(br2)  這是一個基於Forge開發的我的世界模組，模組中添加了許多$(bold)炫酷$()且實用的動作，而這些動作實際上就源自於現實中的跑酷技術。$(br2)  現在的你將成爲一位跑酷高手，一起來《我的世界》跑酷吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "parcool:textures/gui/entries/logo_round.png"
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
